    "description": "http://www.forbes.com/sites/greatspeculations/2015/03/06/akamai-bolsters-its-value-added-services-with-acquisition-of-xerocole/\n\nSince the acquisition of Xerocole, my team and I have built the cloud DNS services Akamai now offers to customers across the globe.   Based on the AnswerX recursive DNS Server, further enhanced by the addition of Nominum and the CacheServe resolution engine, AnswerX powers DNS worldwide.  We answer a trillion queries per day safely due to its incredible programmability, reliability and speed.\n\nOver the last 10 years we have added ECS, DoT, DoH ODoH (Apple Private Relay) and every other major DNS trend.  Most recently we designed and added the new NS53 service which enhances and protects our customer's Authoritative DNS infrastructure.  The footprint of Akamai's DNS cloud services has expanded from dozens to thousands of machines.\n\nAnswerX, in its licensed form, also powers a number of top tier carrier's DNS infrastructure. \n\nI am proud to serve as the Team's Technical Lead as we continue to grow Akamai's security business.",
